      "explanation": "Ambident ligands are those which have two donor sites but at once it has the ability to donate either site.<br>\nHence in AgCN/KCN, AgNO<sub>2</sub>/KNO<sub>2</sub>, CN<sup>-</sup>, NO<sub>2</sub><sup>-</sup> have two donar sites act as ambident Nu<sup>-</sup>."
